{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13710","headline":"独游青龙寺 · 顾况","name":"独游青龙寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风入香刹，暇日独游衍。\n旷然莲花台，作礼月光面。\n乘兹第八识，出彼超二见。\n摆落区中缘，无边广弘愿。\n长廊朝雨毕，古木时禽啭。\n积翠暧遥原，杂英纷似霰。\n凤城腾日窟，龙首横天堰。\n蚁步避危阶，蝇飞响深殿。\n大通智胜佛，几刦道场现。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}